The code is just auto-sacrificing the first creature it finds without letting the player choose, but the card text clearly states "Sacrifice a creature" — meaning the player should get to pick which one. I also need to verify the `last_known_toughness` ruling to make sure I'm calculating the life gain correctly based on the creature's toughness at the time of sacrifice.

